        {
          "text": " Kotema Daudi Akimelek esasedoti atiar, “Keeorakinit ekabaka eoŋ aswam, katema eoŋ atiar, ‘Kinyek idiotuŋanan ajenun akirot naka aswam nakejukaritor, nakecorakinit da: eeorakinit eoŋ ikatumunak abore kamutan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aso do inyo bo ejai akanikon? Koinakinai imugatin ikany akanika, arai ieebore kere yenejai kaio.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
