              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema esasedoti atiar, “Ekileŋ loka Goliat Epilisitiat, loiari ijo kaditot naka Ela, koany, ejai ne ienienitai kegoe kokau kepod: arai ikoto ayaŋaar, koyana: naarai emamei ece kane dimarai ŋol.” Kotema Daudi atiar, “Emamei ece loeputotor ŋol; koinakinai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
