              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotemasi ikejaanakinak luka Akis ŋes atiar, “Mere lo Daudi ekabaka loka akwap? Mam kes apotu koyeonokinos kokosio ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
